Selecting the wrong state/district or service category.", "Not saving the application/reference number after submission."]','["Do I need to visit an office in person for DigiLocker?", "Can I track my DigiLocker application status online?", "What should I do if my DigiLocker application is rejected?", "Are there any state-specific rules for DigiLocker in Maharashtra?"]','{"certificate","digilocker","digital","digital documents","e-documents","services","wallet"}','https://digilocker.gov.in','html','2025-01-01',1,'9907774c2e184601aa804627b67c87dd381148196dcbdcbe24ed32a488b1cc03') ON CONFLICT (service_id) DO NOTHING;
