es National Scholarship Portal (NSP) take to process?", "What is the official website for National Scholarship Portal (NSP)?"]','["Uploading documents that do not match the name/details on record.", "Using an expired or unlinked mobile number for OTP verification.", "Submitting low-resolution or oversized document scans.", "Selecting the wrong state/district or service category.", "Not saving the application/reference number after submission."]','["Do I need to visit an office in person for National Scholarship Portal (NSP)?", "Can I track my National Scholarship Portal (NSP) application status online?", "What should I do if my National Scholarship Portal (NSP) application is rejected?", "Are there any state-specific rules for National Scholarship Portal (NSP) in Maharashtra?"]','{"education","financial aid","national","nsp","portal","scholarship","student"}','https://scholarships.gov.in','html','2025-01-01',1,'54c7c9ae6c67ce54409c11f7f2f235b95deea7222e2b32b4a57de40df9ae42be') ON CONFLICT (service_id) DO NOTHING;
