 for PAN Card (Permanent Account Number)?", "What is the fee for PAN Card (Permanent Account Number)?", "Who is eligible for PAN Card (Permanent Account Number)?", "How long does PAN Card (Permanent Account Number) take to process?", "What is the official website for PAN Card (Permanent Account Number)?"]','["Uploading documents that do not match the name/details on record.", "Using an expired or unlinked mobile number for OTP verification.", "Submitting low-resolution or oversized document scans.", "Selecting the wrong state/district or service category.", "Not saving the application/reference number after submission."]','["Do I need to visit an office in person for PAN Card (Permanent Account Number)?", "Can I track my PAN Card (Permanent Account Number) application status online?", "What should I do if my PAN Card (Permanent Account Number) application is rejected?", "Are there any state-specific rules for PAN Card (Permanent Account Number) in Maharashtra?"]','{"account","card","e-pan","finance","financial id","income tax","number","pan","permanent","tax"}','https://www.incometax.gov.in/iec/foportal/','html','2025-01-01',1,'02d85b10c296607f79040be04f7d495a680e05cc86f9066b5b40659bc04b386e') ON CONFLICT (service_id) DO NOTHING;
