g does Income Tax Return (ITR) Filing take to process?", "What is the official website for Income Tax Return (ITR) Filing?"]','["Uploading documents that do not match the name/details on record.", "Using an expired or unlinked mobile number for OTP verification.", "Submitting low-resolution or oversized document scans.", "Selecting the wrong state/district or service category.", "Not saving the application/reference number after submission."]','["Do I need to visit an office in person for Income Tax Return (ITR) Filing?", "Can I track my Income Tax Return (ITR) Filing application status online?", "What should I do if my Income Tax Return (ITR) Filing application is rejected?", "Are there any state-specific rules for Income Tax Return (ITR) Filing in Maharashtra?"]','{"efiling","filing","finance","income","income tax return","itr","refund","return","tax"}','https://www.incometax.gov.in/iec/foportal/','html','2025-01-01',1,'ae84a262d4fa779621bd85664cf2baec0813c20add4d2652a9ebd69ef19c2b4f') ON CONFLICT (service_id) DO NOTHING;
