ments are required for Udyam Registration (MSME)?", "What is the fee for Udyam Registration (MSME)?", "Who is eligible for Udyam Registration (MSME)?", "How long does Udyam Registration (MSME) take to process?", "What is the official website for Udyam Registration (MSME)?"]','["Uploading documents that do not match the name/details on record.", "Using an expired or unlinked mobile number for OTP verification.", "Submitting low-resolution or oversized document scans.", "Selecting the wrong state/district or service category.", "Not saving the application/reference number after submission."]','["Do I need to visit an office in person for Udyam Registration (MSME)?", "Can I track my Udyam Registration (MSME) application status online?", "What should I do if my Udyam Registration (MSME) application is rejected?", "Are there any state-specific rules for Udyam Registration (MSME) in Maharashtra?"]','{"business","business registration","enterprise","msme","registration","startup","udyam"}','https://udyamregistration.gov.in','html','2025-01-01',1,'6b1248c01aab5e805c7ccb48c32bf738e5c9ce0a16d418aaded50367a43f9573') ON CONFLICT (service_id) DO NOTHING;
