ort (Fresh / Reissue)?", "Who is eligible for Passport (Fresh / Reissue)?", "How long does Passport (Fresh / Reissue) take to process?", "What is the official website for Passport (Fresh / Reissue)?"]','["Uploading documents that do not match the name/details on record.", "Using an expired or unlinked mobile number for OTP verification.", "Submitting low-resolution or oversized document scans.", "Selecting the wrong state/district or service category.", "Not saving the application/reference number after submission."]','["Do I need to visit an office in person for Passport (Fresh / Reissue)?", "Can I track my Passport (Fresh / Reissue) application status online?", "What should I do if my Passport (Fresh / Reissue) application is rejected?", "Are there any state-specific rules for Passport (Fresh / Reissue) in Maharashtra?"]','{"fresh","identity","mea","passport","psk","reissue","tatkaal","travel"}','https://www.passportindia.gov.in/psp','html','2025-01-01',1,'994bfac4cb2c67c488008693354ef8f0ca58002576c7562a9fbbda02b12aaaf5') ON CONFLICT (service_id) DO NOTHING;
