r Ayushman Bharat PM-JAY (Ayushman Card)?", "How long does Ayushman Bharat PM-JAY (Ayushman Card) take to process?", "What is the official website for Ayushman Bharat PM-JAY (Ayushman Card)?"]','["Uploading documents that do not match the name/details on record.", "Using an expired or unlinked mobile number for OTP verification.", "Submitting low-resolution or oversized document scans.", "Selecting the wrong state/district or service category.", "Not saving the application/reference number after submission."]','["Do I need to visit an office in person for Ayushman Bharat PM-JAY (Ayushman Card)?", "Can I track my Ayushman Bharat PM-JAY (Ayushman Card) application status online?", "What should I do if my Ayushman Bharat PM-JAY (Ayushman Card) application is rejected?", "Are there any state-specific rules for Ayushman Bharat PM-JAY (Ayushman Card) in Maharashtra?"]','{"abha","ayushman","bharat","card","health insurance","healthcare","hospital","jay","pmjay"}','https://pmjay.gov.in','html','2025-01-01',1,'dee82bec285c3b0b4a8c5269d70562b4b01a72b3b6ee52b9d94fc22cc61427bf') ON CONFLICT (service_id) DO NOTHING;
