e fee for Income Certificate (Maharashtra)?", "Who is eligible for Income Certificate (Maharashtra)?", "How long does Income Certificate (Maharashtra) take to process?", "What is the official website for Income Certificate (Maharashtra)?"]','["Uploading documents that do not match the name/details on record.", "Using an expired or unlinked mobile number for OTP verification.", "Submitting low-resolution or oversized document scans.", "Selecting the wrong state/district or service category.", "Not saving the application/reference number after submission."]','["Do I need to visit an office in person for Income Certificate (Maharashtra)?", "Can I track my Income Certificate (Maharashtra) application status online?", "What should I do if my Income Certificate (Maharashtra) application is rejected?", "Are there any state-specific rules for Income Certificate (Maharashtra) in Maharashtra?"]','{"aaple sarkar","certificate","certificates","income","income certificate","maharashtra","revenue","utpanna dakhla"}','https://aaplesarkar.mahaonline.gov.in','html','2025-01-01',1,'3d4e8731fba845c44db3f4646ea51a2cf5962dc5062b1b63e83947faf3b708d8') ON CONFLICT (service_id) DO NOTHING;
