 Domicile / Residence Certificate (Maharashtra)?", "Who is eligible for Domicile / Residence Certificate (Maharashtra)?", "How long does Domicile / Residence Certificate (Maharashtra) take to process?", "What is the official website for Domicile / Residence Certificate (Maharashtra)?"]','["Uploading documents that do not match the name/details on record.", "Using an expired or unlinked mobile number for OTP verification.", "Submitting low-resolution or oversized document scans.", "Selecting the wrong state/district or service category.", "Not saving the application/reference number after submission."]','["Do I need to visit an office in person for Domicile / Residence Certificate (Maharashtra)?", "Can I track my Domicile / Residence Certificate (Maharashtra) application status online?", "What should I do if my Domicile / Residence Certificate (Maharashtra) application is rejected?", "Are there any state-specific rules for Domicile / Residence Certificate (Maharashtra) in Maharashtra?"]','{"aaple sarkar","certificate","certificates","domicile","maharashtra","residence","residence certificate","vasti dakhla"}','https://aaplesarkar.mahaonline.gov.in','html','2025-01-01',1,'cd9b9ad026407c4f4bcfad3105464132590e095cbadf4ec4f9f4a8e101d5105e') ON CONFLICT (service_id) DO NOTHING;
